      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, you said DVT is more likely to affect the deep nerves? i thought that was a blood clot thing... and why would fatigue cause shortness of breath? that sounds kinda scary if it's more than just being tired. do i really need to go to the hospital or can i just sleep it off and drink some Gatorade?",
